0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-add-space:auto;=20text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;line-height:30.0000pt;=20mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >（一）做好新冠肺炎疫情防控工作，确保监所安全稳定。根据省厅、区局工作部署，区看守所慎终如始严格落实人员进出管理、隔离防护、健康监测、消毒等疫情防控措施，统筹做好疫情防控和监管工作，全面做好庆祝党建</font><font face=3D"仿宋" >100周年安保维稳工作。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;=20font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-add-space:auto;=20text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;line-height:30.0000pt;=20mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >（二）深入开展队伍教育整顿工作。</font><font face=3D"仿宋" >2021年看守所在区局党委、监管支队党支部的领导下，坚持以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，深入学习党史、新中国史、改革开发史、社会主义发展史，切实把学习教育成果同深入开展队伍整顿结合起来，做到学以致用、用以促学，不断增强“四个意识”、坚定“四个自信”、做到“两个维护”，落实全面从严管党治警措施，确保全体党员民警忠诚履职尽责。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;=20font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-add-space:auto;=20text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;line-height:30.0000pt;=20mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >（三）开展</font><font face=3D"仿宋" >“强基础、补短板、抓规范、促提升”活动。建立完善疫情常态化防控条件下规范有序、严密有效的监所安全管理模式，规范监区秩序管控，持之以恒落实被监管人员一日生活规范、行为规范。全面落实管教民警“双主管”责任制和直接管理监室、双人巡控值班等制度。强化风险管控，抓好出所就医、提讯会见、单人关押、群进群出和午间夜间等高风险环节、部位、时段管控，刚性落实“三条铁律”“三个严禁”“三个必须”和“七个确保”。落实安全检查和隐患排查，发现各类隐患并及时整改到位，确保内部安全稳定。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;=20font-size:16.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:32.0000pt;=20mso-char-indent-count:2.0000;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;=20mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;=20mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  align=3Dcenter  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;=20mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-align:center;line-height:30.0000pt;=20mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:黑体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;=