ent-count:2.0000;line-height:30.0000pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >（一）</font><font face=3D"仿宋" >2040201公安-行政运行198万元，较上年决算数增加138.92万元，增长235.14%。主要原因是根据区公安局财务管理相关规定，2021年将年度预算安排在区局的项目经费（指监管支队、看守所、拘留所民警公用经费）拨入看守所账户，由监管支队统筹管理，故相关收入支出</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:15.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >呈正比例上升</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >（二）</font><font face=3D"仿宋" >2040202公安-一般行政管理事务411.58万元，</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:15.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >主要用于为保障在押人员伙食费、医务室购置医疗器械、医疗器械维护、药品消</font> <font face=3D"仿宋" >耗、在押人员医疗费、应急抢救费等各项资金；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;font-size:16.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >较上年决算数增加</font><font face=3D"仿宋" >201.92万元，增长96.31%。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:仿宋;color:rgb(0,0,0);=20font-size:15.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"仿宋" >主要原因是</font><font face=3D"仿宋" >2021年随着各办案单位工作推进，区看守所关押量大幅增加，相关支出呈正比例上升。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:0.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:32.0000pt;=20